WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.210
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.210
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:46.070
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:46.070
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:12.680
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:12.680
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.620
<i>To rescue the Holy Digimon
who turned into a Digitama,</i>

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:45.630
<i>Taichi, Yamato, and Takeru
broke into Devimon's castle.</i>

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:54.380
<i>Meanwhile, Devimon's hands of evil were
taking over tankers in the real world,</i>

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:57.800
<i>and trying to throw the world
into a state of turmoil.</i>

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:04.520
<i>On the other hand,
Taichi's side was fighting Skullknightmon</i>

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:07.020
<i>who was trying to dye the Digitama dark.</i>

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:18.660
<i>Amid the battle, Skullknightmon
evolved into a powerful Darkknightmon,</i>

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:23.210
<i>and the fierce battle led to
the collapse of Devimon's castle.</i>

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.500
<i>And after the battle,</i>

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:35.930
<i>Takeru finally retrieved the Digitama
and Poyomon hatched before Takeru's eyes.</i>

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.430
<i>However,</i>

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:43.520
<i>before they could catch their breath,
Devimon made an appearance at last.</i>

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:49.980
<i>How will Taichi and friends
stand up to this worst enemy ever?!</i>

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:57.820
THE MESSENGER OF DARKNESS, DEVIMON

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.960
The Chosen Ones...

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.340
And...

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:14.920
my dear old friend.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:18.930
Takeru, stay hidden!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:19.970
Okay!

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.640
Devimon.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:27.600
Both the disasters of our world
and the Digital World...

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.610
If you were the one
who planned all this...

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:34.610
Everything should end with this battle!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.740
My pain...

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.740
Can you fight, Weregarurumon?!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:41.620
Yeah!

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.620
You shall feel my pain.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.450
Metalgreymon!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:47.370
Yeah!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.600
Death Claw.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.180
What?!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.270
Everyone, hide!

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:12.770
Yamato!

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:13.940
Stay there!

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.900
What was that attack just now?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.620
<i>Use the debris as cover and get closer.</i>

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:25.870
Got it!

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:49.850
What?!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.280
Metalgreymon!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.420
What happened to the tanker?

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:21.050
We still can't get the system back!

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.430
What?!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.930
Hasn't the system recovered yet?

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.230
No, though I'm not seeing
any problems...

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.230
Check once more!

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:34.190
Yes, sir!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:43.490
Wasn't that Calamaramon thing defeated?!

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.200
No, not yet.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.700
Calamaramon must still be
hiding somewhere!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.710
Are you watching, Koshiro-san?!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:55.250
Something strange is happening!

00:05:56.420 --> 00:06:00.380
All the data flowing
within the network is gathering?!

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:01.970
What do you mean?

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.680
I hadn't explained to you two yet.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.590
Please look at this.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:09.310
The data the Algomon were eating...

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.390
News and social media data,

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:16.480
data in the network traffic
that's been activated by confusion.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:21.690
That lighthouse-like obelisk
is absorbing all of it.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:24.450
That data is transferred further...

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.160
Oh! To the Digital World!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.120
Isn't that...

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:36.920
Something similar to what happened
in fake Tokyo is recurring over there?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:41.460
Taichi-san and Yamato-san
could very much be in danger!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.430
It's miasma!

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:54.770
Devimon's controlling this dark mist
like a solid substance!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:00.320
So that means this entire space
is like Devimon's limbs.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.550
The attacks have stopped?

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:29.180
Now's our chance...
We can blow away all this mist!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.680
Metalgreymon!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.390
Okay!

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.820
Then we'll just break that obelisk there!

00:07:47.990 --> 00:07:48.740
Togemon!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.320
Birdramon, please!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:52.780
Leave it to me, Mimi!

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.830
We'll destroy it at once!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.130
That came out of nowhere!

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:06.380
It's camouflage!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:12.640
Don't forget that I'm here!

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:26.730
It's hot!

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.450
I'm gonna melt!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.110
Stop!

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.120
Takeru!

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:26.340
Don't you...

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.300
bully my friends!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.310
Poyomon!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.160
TOKOMON

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.620
Tokomon!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.080
Poyomon evolved!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.510
Why resist darkness...

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.180
Why do you resist me...

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:22.560
Why... Why...

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.020
Takeru!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:43.960
What's this?!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:47.920
The energy being sent
to the Digital World is increasing...

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.500
and accelerating!

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.780
I... I...

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.640
Super Evolution...

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.680
Neodevimon.

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.470
NEODEVIMON

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:48.230
I'm done for...

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:49.900
Kabuterimon!

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:51.440
At this rate--

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:53.230
No, it's okay!

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.490
W-Where?!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.620
I thought... it'd be okay.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:10.920
This isn't good!

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.090
I apologize!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.130
Not that!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:14.000
What?

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.010
The first tanker
is about to crash into the port!

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:27.180
An evolution!

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.940
Not only that...

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:33.820
Something feels
completely different than before.

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:52.420
Tokomon!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.090
Behind you!

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.430
Guilty Claw.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.310
What?!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.480
Kaiser Nail!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.950
Weregarurumon!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.910
Giga Storm!

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:55.230
At this rate...

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:59.610
<i>Taichi-san... Yamato-san...
do you hear me?</i>

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.740
Koshiro?!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.700
<i>How's... the situation?</i>

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.700
Right now, we're...

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.410
<i>We're... now...</i>

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:12.870
Koshiro...

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.330
Taichi-san!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.460
So Taichi was fighting after all.

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:22.260
Another ridiculous enemy
must've appeared on the other side!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:43.820
No...

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:47.950
We'll do it.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.830
I know we can do this!

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.260
<i>Us fighting here...</i>

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.930
<i>This will surely benefit
Taichi-san, and everyone</i>

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:12.350
<i>who is fighting
in the Digital World right now.</i>

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:17.270
<i>Even if we're far away,
right now, we're all fighting together!</i>

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:20.400
<i>Please, Togemon!</i>

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.440
<i>Birdramon...</i>

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.200
<i>I'm counting on you, Ikkakumon!</i>

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.120
<i>Kabuterimon...</i>

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:37.460
Togemon Super Evolution!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.390
Lilimon!

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:57.520
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:07.950
Garudamon!

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:14.160
Kabuterimon Super Evolution!

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.050
Atlurkabuterimon!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:32.470
Ikkakumon Super Evolution!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.400
Zudomon!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:48.900
Here we go!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.400
All right!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.790
Let's see who's stronger!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.540
Flower Cannon!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.550
Shadow Wing!

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:12.260
Horn Buster!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.600
Just the obelisk now!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.440
We'll be okay this time!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:26.650
Zudomon!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:30.110
Hammer Spark!

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:15.740
Weregarurumon!

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:27.880
System has recovered!

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.880
Full speed astern!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.050
Turn on the brake system!
Starboard at the same time!

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:34.470
Hard to starboard!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.050
Hard to starboard! Steady!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.850
Please... stop!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.980
Now, Metalgreymon!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:49.860
Yeah!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.700
Giga Destroyer!

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.040
It... stopped.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:51.420
But... who saved us?

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.800
I've confirmed the system's recovery!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:00.390
It's a success!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.060
Hooray!

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:11.020
What's the matter?

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.980
Everyone back home saved us...

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.240
That's what I feel.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.160
You did good too, Takeru.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.820
For the perseverance that exceeds one's
own ruin, let there be a last evolution!

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.340
Could that be...

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.620
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.620
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.290
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:48.290
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.750
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.750
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:56.340
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:56.340
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.840
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.840
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.210
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.210
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.130
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.130
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.300
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.300
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:08.390
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:08.390
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.680
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.680
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.640
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.640
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:15.850
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:15.850
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:19.110
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:19.110
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.360
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.360
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:25.280
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:25.280
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:33.120
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:35.290
<i>Lilimon.</i>

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:38.250
<i>This is a Fairy Digimon
that super evolves from Togemon.</i>

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:38.250
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:40.840
TYPE: FAIRY

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:43.420
<i>Lilimon confuses enemies with that small
body and blasts Flower Cannon on them.</i>

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:43.420
SPECIAL MOVE: FLOWER CANNON

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:45.680
<i>Check out this mystery point!</i>

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:50.890
<i>It seems all super-evolved Digimon
look like their previous evolution.</i>

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:53.980
<i>But for Lilimon,
there's almost zero resemblance.</i>

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>The mystery of Digimon...</i>

00:22:57.810 --> 00:23:00.020
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:03.990
<i>Taichi falls.</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:07.740
<i>However, a new hope shines
and a miracle occurs!</i>

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:11.910
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Final Stage, Donedevimon"</i>

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
